          "path": "/mnt/e/skillpilot-chemie-L7-20261017/paired-all-seven-packages-and-HB7f-actual-current650-technical-v1/capsule/curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/prompts/chemistry-goal-description-understanding-evidence-review-criteria-v1.md",
