      "titleDe": "Synthetischen Kautschuk und Vulkanisation erklären",
      "ownerIndexPath": "curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-10-16/chemie-current435-seventeen-pending-description-native-technical-20261016-v1/native-seventeen/resolution-index.json",
